-- Scene 5: the readers COMPOSE with the writers --
  [ok]   ABC -> score -> MIDI -> score -> ABC gives back the SAME TEXT, character for character
  [ok]   and 90 BPM comes back from MIDI as 90, not the 89.99995 its microseconds spell (90)
